    skos:scopeNote "Definition and value from the California Doughnut Snapshot (pp. 9-12), updated 2026-10-23; the value is the report's percentage shortfall below the social foundation. Earlier paraphrased definition: 'The percentage of households with reliable, high-speed broadband connections.'"@en .

tgs:Indicator.TransitReportCard a thinkr:Indicator, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    skos:inScheme tgs:ConceptScheme.CaliforniaDoughnutIndicators ;
    skos:broader tgs:IndicatorCategory.ConnectivityAndTransportation ;
