    skos:scopeNote "Definition and value from the California Doughnut Snapshot (pp. 9-12), updated 2026-10-23; the value is the report's percentage shortfall below the social foundation. Earlier paraphrased definition: 'The statistical difference in median earnings between men and women performing comparable work.'"@en .

tgs:Indicator.RacialEquityIndex a thinkr:Indicator, owl:NamedIndividual ;
