    skos:scopeNote "Definition and value from the California Doughnut Snapshot (pp. 9-12), updated 2026-10-23; the value is the report's percentage shortfall below the social foundation. Earlier paraphrased definition: 'An index evaluating law enforcement agencies on use of force, racial disparities, and institutional accountability.'"@en .

