    skos:scopeNote "Definition and value from the California Doughnut Snapshot (pp. 9-12), updated 2026-10-23; the value is the report's percentage shortfall below the social foundation. Earlier paraphrased definition: 'The percentage of eligible voters who cast a ballot during major election cycles.'"@en .

tgs:Indicator.RegisteredVoters a thinkr:Indicator, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    skos:inScheme tgs:ConceptScheme.CaliforniaDoughnutIndicators ;
    skos:broader tgs:IndicatorCategory.PoliticalVoice ;
    dcterms:source tgs:Work.CaliforniaDoughnutReport2025 ;
    thinkr:hasIndicatorCategory tgs:IndicatorCategory.PoliticalVoice ;
    skos:prefLabel "Registered Voters"@en ;
    skos:definition "Share of eligible voters who are not registered."@en ;
    thinkr:shortfallPercent "16"^^xsd:decimal ;
    skos:scopeNote "Definition and value from the California Doughnut Snapshot (pp. 9-12), updated 2026-10-23; the value is the report's percentage shortfall below the social foundation. Earlier paraphrased definition: 'The proportion of eligible citizens officially signed up to participate in the democratic voting process.'"@en .

#############################################
# Nitrogen & Phosphorus
#############################################

tgs:Indicator.EutrophicationPotential a thinkr:Indicator, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    skos:inScheme tgs:ConceptScheme.CaliforniaDoughnutIndicators ;
    skos:broader tgs:IndicatorCategory.NitrogenAndPhosphorus ;
    dcterms:source tgs:Work.CaliforniaDoughnutReport2025 ;
    thinkr:hasIndicatorCategory tgs:IndicatorCategory.NitrogenAndPhosphorus ;
    skos:prefLabel "Eutrophication Potential"@en ;
    skos:definition "Eutrophication potential footprint per capita."@en ;
    thinkr:overshootPercent "657"^^xsd:decimal ;
    skos:scopeNote "Definition and value from the California Doughnut Snapshot (pp. 9-12), updated 2026-10-23; the value is the report's percentage overshoot beyond the ecological ceiling. Earlier paraphrased definition: 'The risk of severe oxygen depletion in water bodies caused by nutrient enrichment (algal blooms).'"@en .

tgs:Indicator.NitrogenLeached a thinkr:Indicator, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    skos:inScheme tgs:ConceptScheme.CaliforniaDoughnutIndicators ;
    skos:broader tgs:IndicatorCategory.NitrogenAndPhosphorus ;
    dcterms:source tgs:Work.CaliforniaDoughnutReport2025 ;
    thinkr:hasIndicatorCategory tgs:IndicatorCategory.NitrogenAndPhosphorus ;
    skos:prefLabel "Nitrogen Leached"@en ;
    skos:definition "Nitrogen leached to groundwater per year."@en ;
    thinkr:overshootPercent "209"^^xsd:decimal ;
    skos:scopeNote "Definition and value from the California Doughnut Snapshot (pp. 9-12), updated 2026-10-23; the value is the report's percentage overshoot beyond the ecological ceiling. Earlier paraphrased definition: 'The volume of excess agricultural nitrogen escaping into underground aquifers and surface waters.'"@en .

#############################################
# Ozone Depletion
#############################################

tgs:Indicator.OzoneDepletingSubstances a thinkr:Indicator, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    skos:inScheme tgs:ConceptScheme.CaliforniaDoughnutIndicators ;
    skos:broader tgs:IndicatorCategory.OzoneDepletion ;
    dcterms:source tgs:Work.CaliforniaDoughnutReport2025 ;
    thinkr:hasIndicatorCategory tgs:IndicatorCategory.OzoneDepletion ;
    skos:prefLabel "Ozone-Depleting Substances"@en ;
    skos:definition "Compliance with the Montreal Protocol."@en ;
    thinkr:overshootPercent "0"^^xsd:decimal ;
    skos:scopeNote "Definition and value from the California Doughnut Snapshot (pp. 9-12), updated 2026-10-23; the value is the report's percentage overshoot beyond the ecological ceiling. Earlier paraphrased definition: 'The volume of regulated synthetic industrial chemicals (like CFCs) released into the air.' Not in overshoot: Ozone Depletion is the only ecological category within its ceiling."@en .

tgs:Indicator.OzoneLayer a thinkr:Indicator, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    skos:inScheme tgs:ConceptScheme.CaliforniaDoughnutIndicators ;
    skos:broader tgs:IndicatorCategory.OzoneDepletion ;
    dcterms:source tgs:Work.CaliforniaDoughnutReport2025 ;
    thinkr:hasIndicatorCategory tgs:IndicatorCategory.OzoneDepletion ;
    skos:prefLabel "Ozone Layer"@en ;
    skos:definition "Ozone layer thickness against the global average minimum thickness threshold."@en ;
    thinkr:overshootPercent "0"^^xsd:decimal ;
    skos:scopeNote "Definition and value from the California Doughnut Snapshot (pp. 9-12), updated 2026-10-23; the value is the report's percentage overshoot beyond the ecological ceiling. Earlier paraphrased definition: 'The density and health of stratospheric ozone, which filters out cancer-causing ultraviolet (UV) rays.' Not in overshoot: Ozone Depletion is the only ecological category within its ceiling."@en .

